# =============================================================================
# 中文说明
# 下方为完整中文说明；实际配置值统一放在文件末尾，请在那里修改。
# =============================================================================
# 直接运行 Relay 二进制／systemd 服务的环境变量模板，不会启动内置代理。
# 需另行安装 Relay 程序、deploy/spool-relay.service 和 HTTPS 前置代理。
# 保存为 /etc/spool-relay/relay.env，权限设为 600，服务通过 EnvironmentFile 读取。
# 修改后执行 systemctl restart spool-relay；前置代理配置需单独同步。
# Docker Compose 部署请使用 relay/.env.example，包括不启用内置 Caddy 的情况。
# 不要在此填写 COMPOSE_PROFILES、Caddy 参数或 Compose 的宿主机端口映射。
# 监听地址、端口和数据目录由服务 ExecStart 的启动参数指定。

# =============================================================================
# 一、Relay 服务使用：完整的 Relay 进程环境变量
# =============================================================================
# 必填：管理员凭据，32–512 个字符，不允许换行。
# 生成命令：openssl rand -hex 32；仅用于管理，不是服务器注册 token。
# SPOOL_RELAY_ADMIN_TOKEN=

# 可选值：
# true：默认值，要求管理员签发的注册 token。
# false：允许服务器凭签名身份自动注册，并获得自己的 token。
# 两种模式都必须设置管理员凭据。
# RELAY_REQUIRE_REGISTRATION_TOKEN=true

# Relay 公网 HTTPS 地址，例如 https://relay.example.com，可带非标准端口。
# 不能包含路径、查询、片段或用户名密码。
# 地址必须到达公网服务监听器（28080），不是管理监听器（28081）。
# 发布 Web 和启动自动检测代理时需要填写。
# 留空：仅提供原生 Relay 连接，关闭 Web 发布和自动代理检测。
# 始终读取部署值，不会被旧的管理页保存值覆盖。
# Web 后缀自动使用 web.<此地址的主机名>，不支持自定义。
# 例如主入口为 relay.example.com，每台服务器使用
# https://<服务器ID>.web.relay.example.com/；提前配置 *.web.relay.example.com 的 DNS 和 HTTPS。
# RELAY_PUBLIC_URL=

# =============================================================================
# 二、Relay 的可选 Traefik/Coolify 集成：Caddy/Nginx 不使用这些参数
# =============================================================================
# 独立只读凭据，32–512 个字符，不允许换行；留空关闭配置发现接口。
# 单独生成：openssl rand -hex 32，不能与管理员凭据相同。
# Traefik 的 HTTP Provider 访问私有 28082 配置接口时发送相同的 Bearer 值。
# RELAY_TRAEFIK_TOKEN=

# 可选值：
# letsencrypt：默认值，引用 Traefik 已有的同名解析器。
# 其他名称：已有的自定义解析器，名称可含字母、数字、'-' 和 '_'。
# none：使用代理已加载的匹配证书，不触发 ACME 申请；none 是保留值。
# 解析器本身以及 DNS API、ACME 账号、证书存储仍由 Traefik 配置。
# RELAY_TRAEFIK_RESOLVER=letsencrypt

# Traefik 实际可达的 Relay 后端地址，支持 http:// 或 https://，可带端口。
# 不能包含路径、查询、片段或用户名密码。程序默认值为 http://relay:28080；
# 本模板显式改为回环地址，适用于 Traefik 与 systemd Relay 位于同一宿主机的情况。
# Traefik 若在容器中，不能用容器自己的 127.0.0.1 访问宿主机服务，需要另行调整
# 服务监听地址和受保护的宿主机／容器网络，并填写对应地址。
# RELAY_PROXY_UPSTREAM=http://127.0.0.1:28080

# 可信代理只通过管理页和自动检测维护，无需 env。
# 证书申请、存储、DNS API 凭据和续期由前置 Caddy/Traefik 管理。

# =============================================================================
# English guide
# The complete English guide follows. Edit the active configuration values at the end.
# =============================================================================
# Environment template for a standalone Relay binary or systemd service; starts no bundled proxy.
# Install Relay, deploy/spool-relay.service, and an HTTPS front proxy separately.
# Save as /etc/spool-relay/relay.env with mode 600; the service reads it via EnvironmentFile.
# After editing, run systemctl restart spool-relay and update the front proxy separately.
# Docker Compose deployments use relay/.env.example, including those without bundled Caddy.
# Do not put COMPOSE_PROFILES, Caddy settings, or Compose host port mappings here.
# Listener addresses, ports, and the data directory are set by the service's ExecStart arguments.

# =============================================================================
# 1. Relay service: complete set of Relay process environment variables
# =============================================================================
# Required administrator credential: 32–512 characters, with no line breaks.
# Generate with openssl rand -hex 32; used only for management, separate from server registration tokens.
# SPOOL_RELAY_ADMIN_TOKEN=

# Options:
# true: default; require a registration token issued by an administrator.
# false: allow servers to enroll automatically using a signed identity and receive a token.
# An administrator credential is required in both modes.
# RELAY_REQUIRE_REGISTRATION_TOKEN=true

# Public HTTPS origin, such as https://relay.example.com; an optional nonstandard port is allowed.
# No path, query, fragment, or user information.
# Must reach the public service listener (28080), rather than management (28081).
# Required for Web publishing and automatic proxy detection at startup.
# Empty: provide native Relay connections with Web publishing and detection disabled.
# The deployed value always takes precedence over old saved management settings.
# The Web suffix is always web.<this URL's hostname> and cannot be customized.
# For relay.example.com, each server uses https://<server-id>.web.relay.example.com/.
# Configure DNS and HTTPS for *.web.relay.example.com before deployment.
# RELAY_PUBLIC_URL=

# =============================================================================
# 2. Optional Traefik/Coolify integration: unused by Caddy/Nginx
# =============================================================================
# Separate read-only credential: 32–512 characters, with no line breaks.
# Empty: disable configuration discovery.
# Generate separately with openssl rand -hex 32; must differ from the administrator credential.
# Traefik's HTTP provider sends the same Bearer value to the private configuration API on port 28082.
# RELAY_TRAEFIK_TOKEN=

# Options:
# letsencrypt: default; reference an existing Traefik resolver of that name.
# Other names: an existing custom resolver; letters, digits, '-' and '_' are allowed.
# none: use a matching certificate already loaded by the proxy without ACME requests;
#       the name none is reserved.
# Configure the resolver, DNS API credentials, ACME account, and certificate storage in Traefik.
# RELAY_TRAEFIK_RESOLVER=letsencrypt

# Relay backend URL reachable from Traefik; accepts http:// or https:// and an optional port.
# No path, query, fragment, or user information. The program default is http://relay:28080.
# This template explicitly uses loopback for Traefik and systemd Relay running on the same host.
# Containerized Traefik cannot reach the host's service through its own 127.0.0.1.
# Adjust the service listener and protected host/container network, then set a reachable address.
# RELAY_PROXY_UPSTREAM=http://127.0.0.1:28080

# Trusted proxies are managed through the management page and automatic detection; no env is needed.
# The front Caddy/Traefik proxy manages certificate issuance, storage, DNS API credentials, and renewal.

# =============================================================================
# 配置值 / Configuration values
# =============================================================================
# Relay
SPOOL_RELAY_ADMIN_TOKEN=
RELAY_REQUIRE_REGISTRATION_TOKEN=true
RELAY_PUBLIC_URL=

# Traefik
RELAY_TRAEFIK_TOKEN=
RELAY_TRAEFIK_RESOLVER=letsencrypt
RELAY_PROXY_UPSTREAM=http://127.0.0.1:28080
